==Description==
The '''Gingerbread Nametag''' is a nametag that could be obtained at Level 14 of the regular [[Operation I.C.E Event#Operation I.C.E Event Battle Pass|Operation I.C.E Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it costed {{Bell|410}} or {{Robux|58}} to unlock it, with a total cost of {{Bell|2,460}} or {{Robux|930}}.

The '''Gingerbread Nametag''' has brown, white, green, white and brown gradient text with a translucent outline using an identical gradient. Behind the text multiple gingerbread Christmas tree cookies can be seen falling out of it, getting smaller as they fall.

